Third-party data that is NOT redistributed
------------------------------------------

The UCI PhiUSIIL Phishing URL Dataset (CC BY 4.0) and the Kaggle datasets
used by E4c are downloaded at run time and verified by SHA-256; they are not
part of this repository. Their licenses are listed in README.md.

Upstream protocol sources (AP2, ACP, x402) are fetched at the commits pinned
in data/upstream/PINS.txt and are not redistributed.

Security note
-------------

The Groth16 setup in zk/ uses fixed test entropy. It must not be used to
protect real payments.
